<title>USA: Salant stake raised by DDJ Group.</title>
<headline>Salant stake raised by DDJ Group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>DDJ Capital Management LLC and its affiliates said Friday they had raised their stake in Salant Corp to 1,155,400 common shares, or 7.84 percent. It previously held a 6.73 percent stake.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, DDJ capital said the latest transactions included the purchase of 162,900 shares October 8-17. The filing did not give a price per share breakdown.</p>
</text>
